  "historyNote": "#6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1000); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2705.05); ss by #10598, eff 7-1-14; ss by #13864, eff 2-6-24",
